contentText:
There&#8217;s a special place where boys and girls can all be queens &#8212; or heavy metal-loving horned monsters &#8212; every single day. That&#8217;s (more or less) the lesson behind Chappell Roan &#8216;s hit &#8220;Pink Pony Club,&#8221; which GWAR took to heart with a thrashing cover of the unexpected track.

